                                <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background: var(--accent-gold); border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; color: #000;">1</div>
                                <div>
                                    <div style="font-weight: 600;">Tap the menu button</div>
